TEXT -832 -96 Left 2 ;The generator starts at t=0s with speed of 1500turns. \nThe generator acts at the begin as motor starting from the net\nFrom 0 to 10s the generator outputs active power from zero to 400MW\nThe active power output is a bit lower than 400MW because of internal lost in generator (copper lost, friction)\nThe current output is the nominal of 14.4kA because the reactive power output is the nominal 300MVAr \n(SN*sinphi=500MW*0.6=300MW).\nSN=PN/cosphi=400MW/0.8=500MVA
